Provides: spiflash
Description: database of SPI flash chips: JEDEC ids, sizes, erase geometry
 spiflash answers "which chip answered this JEDEC id?" and "what does this
 part answer?" for SPI NOR and SPI NAND flash, from one database merged from
 the flash tables in Linux, U-Boot, flashrom, flashprog, OpenOCD and
 openFPGALoader, with the JEP106 manufacturer list.
 .
 Each chip id carries the part names every source gives it, its size, page
 and sector size, erase opcodes and block layouts, supply voltage and
 capabilities (dual/quad/octal read, QPI, 4-byte addressing, SFDP, OTP),
 with the places where the sources disagree kept visible and every entry
 traced to the upstream file and line it came from.
 .
 This package provides the spiflash Python module and the spiflash command.
